{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Savanna Sam</strong> is a <strong>3D action game</strong> where you take over the controls of Sam\u2019s trusty biplane and help him on his dangerous journey. Make sure Sam reaches his destination and can make his delivery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay of Savanna Sam is similar to console classic <strong>Star Fox</strong>, replacing the shooting with even more barrel rolls!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evade all obstacles</strong> in the colorful levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure both Sam and his plane reach the end of the level without a scratch!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect</strong> all the <strong>golden rings and items</strong> popping up throughout the levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rotate</strong> Sam to fit through any gap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Sam\u2019s neck to collect even hard to reach items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the <strong>story mode</strong> to see how Sam\u2019s adventure unfolds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to make the trip through the Savanna?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Off to a great start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3038250/8ec74b46a172ca354d295d821cada20aeceb9990.jpg"},{"name":"Nosedive","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3038250/898adde24c3fc780d9d199a47fd5406cb79b6c31.jpg"},{"name":"Shift change","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3038250/af2054c6bfa5b6ceb88a66c227360fd9d7cf1cb9.jpg"},{"name":"Mayday, mayday!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3038250/6d59c9240a40ae58378fac9e07c705e2a2dab0c3.jpg"},{"name":"Paying off the plane loan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/pub